<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Spicer sees higher 96/97 net profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Spicer sees higher 96/97 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paper merchant Spicers Paper Ltd said on Friday it expected a higher net profit in the year to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;We are quite confident that our net profit performance in the current year will exceed that of the one just concluded,&quot; Spicers managing director Peter Hammond told reporters after the annual general meeting.</p>
</text>
